    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in the heart of Lismore Heritage Town - this 2 storey end of terrace 3 bedroom property is most deceptive from the outside.A stroll from everything the town has to offer the property is in good order and ready for immediate occupation. Stepping inside, the spacious living room is to the front with a large window, open fireplace and plenty of room for furniture. The kitchen/dining room is to the rear and is the full width of the house with a modern fitted kitchen, dining area with open fire and French doors to the rear south facing garden which is enclosed my old stone walls.Upstairs, the main bedroom is a fine size and overlooks the street with the second and third bedrooms to the rear. The main bathroom is off the landing and services all bedrooms. This is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a townhouse in one of West Waterford's most historic towns."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Prime town centre location - a stroll to all amenities. </li><li>Deceptively spacious - over 1,000 sq.ft.</li><li>Large living room. </li><li>Modern kitchen.</li><li>South facing garden enclosed by old stone walls.</li><li>Downstairs WC.</li><li>Oil fired heating.</li><li>Mains services.</ul>"
      },
